# Skills: live in ~/.agents (managed by the `skills` CLI / npx skills) and
# symlinked in here, plus *-workspace scratch from skill-eval runs — not git's job.
# `/skills/*` (not `/skills/`) so individual hand-authored skills can be re-included
# below; git will not descend into a directory excluded as a whole.
/skills/*

# Exception: hand-authored, not npx-managed. Owns the model-routing table that
# CLAUDE.md §3 delegates to, so it needs version history and VPS sync.
!/skills/efficient-frontier/

